-- Reader has SELECT on the view but not on the base table: EXPLAIN matches SELECT and is allowed
SELECT via DEFINER view: OK
SELECT via DEFINER view (inline): OK
EXPLAIN QUERY TREE DEFINER view: OK
EXPLAIN QUERY TREE DEFINER view (inline): OK
EXPLAIN SYNTAX DEFINER view (inline): OK
EXPLAIN QUERY TREE DEFINER view count (inline): OK
EXPLAIN QUERY TREE NONE view (inline): OK
-- Outsider has no access: EXPLAIN is denied exactly as a plain SELECT would be
EXPLAIN QUERY TREE DEFINER view: ACCESS_DENIED
EXPLAIN SYNTAX DEFINER view: ACCESS_DENIED
EXPLAIN QUERY TREE base table (inline): ACCESS_DENIED
